	quest.0B9F12FC3A0D76DB.quest_desc: ["&6Gate:&r the &eIron Age&r opens. The &dSeal of Iron&r unlocks iron tools and armor.\\n\\nYour backpack grows to &6Copper&r, and here is your first &bWaystone&r: place it at home and teleport back from any other waystone."]
