	quest.49B06BFB39366D86.quest_desc: ["Hover any item and press &eR&r to see its recipe, or &eU&r to see what it is used for. The list on the right side of your inventory is &bJEI&r; search it with the box at the bottom.\\n\\nAlso try &eJade&r: look at any block and a label at the top tells you what it is."]
